   "comment_0":"Sensing reset is problematic as the edge cannot be detected (as it would reset the design). Only state of reset can be confirmed!
The sys_clock is samples at 400 MHz while the clock itself runs at 100MHz. We should see 4 ticks per 100 Mhz cycle (which is true)",
